	(text "J3: Molex Mini-Fit Jr 2x7 (pinout in documents/README.md): fused 12 V and 5 V, sensor ground, three digital\ninputs, two analog inputs, two low-side outputs, CAN.\nSpare MCU pins (IGN6-8, I2C, OUT_PWM3, IN_RES2) and every rail are on pads next to the prototype area G1."
